<title>HONG KONG: Starlight interim profit surges 74 pct.</title>
<headline>Starlight interim profit surges 74 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	 6.4    vs 3.7</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)  1.0    vs 1.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	8.92   vs 6.00</p>
<p>    Net			  17.49  vs 10.03</p>
<p>    Turnover		   616.74 vs 676.69</p>
<p>    Company name	     Starlight International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		January 22-24</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	 February 3</p>
<p>NOTE - Starlight International makes electronic products. It also engages in property investment and share dealing. Exceptional gain represents profit on sale of associated companies.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
